e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T10:53:16.7433168Z ok - first observation of a non-zero count is a POSSIBLY UNREPAIRED request (no longer a silent baseline)
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T10:53:16.7435582Z ok - an increase attributes the delta
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T10:53:16.7436558Z ok - unchanged attributes nothing
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T10:53:16.7437232Z ok - a counter that went DOWN is a reset: the new count is all new drops
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T10:53:16.7438274Z ok - a reset to zero (fresh master, no drops yet) attributes nothing
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T10:53:16.7439085Z ok - a destination first seen on an INITIALIZED ledger counts fully
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T10:53:16.7439889Z ok - counters are keyed per master: another master's first sighting also counts
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T10:53:16.7441007Z ok - a request is recorded once per destination
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T10:53:16.7441724Z ok - more drops on the same destination extend the entry, not duplicate it
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T10:53:16.7442431Z ok - a destination matching a Slave resolves to its key
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T10:53:16.7443054Z ok - an unmatched destination stays requested and unresolved
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T10:53:16.7443989Z ok - a destination that is now a MASTER is voided, not demoted
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T10:53:16.7444643Z ok - resolution accepts the bare host as well as host:port
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T10:53:16.7445297Z ok - a gated request is HELD with its reason and produces no action
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T10:53:16.7446099Z ok - a held request is not excluded from assignment (only a demoted one is)
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T10:53:16.7446893Z ok - when the gate opens the held request becomes an action and the hold clears
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T10:53:16.7447653Z ok - a demoted node is held out of assignment
